
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Infrastructure Status</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 60px 24px;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .card {
      <p>Environment: <strong>${DEPLOY_ENV}</strong></p>
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 32px;
    }
    .badge {
      color: #166534;
      background: #dcfce7;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    h1 { margin-top: 0; }
    footer { margin-top: 24px; color: #64748b; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Infrastructure Status</h1>
      <p>Containerized web application running on Nginx.</p>
      <span class="badge">Web server available</span>
      <p>Platform: Docker / Azure Container Apps</p>
      <p>Version: ${APP_VERSION}</p>
    </div>
    <footer>Infrastructure as Code · CI/CD · Cloud Engineering</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
